WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
If it weren't for using a secret method that secretly knows the body in exchange for cultivation speed,

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,500
how can i be so fast

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,190
I can't wait

4
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:09,690
To become strong enough in the shortest possible time

5
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:11,190
Then enter the capital

6
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:15,220
Find that woman to settle the score with

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,220
Grandson Ye Xuan meets her grandfather

8
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:21,200
I have heard about you

9
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,700
Become first-class in one year

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,700
Faster than Taizu's time

11
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,700
My grandson wants to ask something

12
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:27,700
Taizu

13
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,960
Is he really a fairy?

14
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,460
You asked directly

15
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:32,960
There are indeed some folk legends

16
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,960
It is said that Taizu descended to earth

17
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:35,960
Or a descendant of God

18
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,460
That’s why we can unify the country and create a great cause

19
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,460
I was also curious when I was young

20
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,460
A great hero like Taizu

21
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
It is possible to become an immortal

22
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,460
But it's a pity

23
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,460
Taizu is not an immortal

24
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:48,460
If he really is an immortal

25
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:50,460
How can we get old, sick and die?

26
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,460
Taizu was also plagued by illness for thousands of years.

27
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:54,460
Finally died on the Dragon's Tread

28
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,960
This is what is recorded in the apostles

29
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,460
I can tell you one thing

30
00:00:58,460 --> 00:00:59,460
have you ever seen

31
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:02,460
I have read the part in the Apostles that records Taizu’s revolt.

32
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:03,960
It is said that Taizu originated from the grass

33
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:04,960
The reason why he can become the world leader

34
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:06,960
It's because I received the three volumes of heavenly books given by the gods.

35
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:08,960
That's for outsiders

36
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:09,960
The real situation is

37
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,960
Taizu was sitting on a boat

38
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,960
Came here from another world

39
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:16,460
It's good to come from another world

40
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:17,960
Just came by boat

41
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:19,960
It's an unprecedented ship

42
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:20,960
Just for the convenience of ruling

43
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,960
That’s why I turned this experience into a myth

44
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,960
Replaced the ship with a divine rule

45
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:26,960
As for the three volumes of heavenly books

46
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:27,960
Is it still there or not?

47
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:28,960
I can’t say for sure
